SUMMARY:Janitzio Mexican Restaurant
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\n**FOR ALL THE ‘HOLIDAY ORPHANS’…..**\
 nWe will meet at ***Janitzio Mexican Restaurant for a late lunch.***\nAddr
 ess: **1053 Spartanburg Hwy\, Hendersonville. (lot'sa parking)**\n**A limi
 t of 16 ppl are welcome to join me.**\n**Please keep your RSVP’s current
 . (I need to let them know how many we got !)**\nWe will meet inside\, fin
 d our table(s) and order.\nI will NOT join tables together. We will share 
 multiple tables.\nI’ll have an HFF sign on the table.\n**Description:**\
 nJanitzio Mexican Restaurant is authentic Mexican cuisine\; a local favori
 te that delivers traditional flavors\, generous portions\, and a welcoming
  atmosphere. The owners are kind and create a family-run atmosphere that m
 akes customers feel welcomed. Vegetarian & ‘American’ food available.\
 nWebsite(s): https://janitzio-mexican-restaurant.website/\nhttps://janitzi
 o-mexican-restaurant.website/menu
