SUMMARY:FYI: Holiday Tree Lighting
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nHoliday Tree Lighting\nNovember 27 @ 5:00 p
 m - 8:00 pm\nAll are welcome to gather on the Historic Courthouse Plaza to
  sing Christmas carols\, sip hot cocoa and watch for the man in red. Kick 
 off Small Business Saturday early by visiting your favorite downtown merch
 ants! Once Santa arrives\, he will flip the switch to illuminate the tree 
 on the plaza and the lights along Main Street.\nhttps://visithendersonvill
 enc.org/event/holiday-tree-lighting\nHenderson County Historic Courthouse\
 n1 Historic Courthouse Square\, Hendersonville
